algorithms.pseudocode:
EVAL-STATE(A, node(a, c₁,...,cₖ), q):
  best ← ∞
  for each (q₁,...,qₖ) ∈ Q^k:
    cost ← δ(a, (q₁,...,qₖ), q)
    for i = 1 to k:
      cost ← cost + EVAL-STATE(A, cᵢ, qᵢ)
    best ← min(best, cost)
  return best

EVAL(A, t):
  return min_{q ∈ Q} EVAL-STATE(A, t, q) + final(q)
